{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>Deserving of lashes.</b> Deserving of lashes, like בן מות (deserving of death), and this <b>בן</b> is like יהושע בן נון, אגור בן יקה." "<b>And shall strike him before him.</b> It refers to the judge, and so our Rabbis said." "<b>According to his wickedness.</b> According to his wickedness, for the wicked one may be given large or small lashes, and all of them in a fixed number."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:54:11.211170785Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}